      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 7.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "I mean, hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.82,
      "end_seconds": 13.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "you're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.96,
      "end_seconds": 25.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.61,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a high reading at the pharmacy. It's getting on my nerves now. I've been putting this off for weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.53,
      "end_seconds": 29.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Did it it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.89,
      "end_seconds": 34.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "For six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.33,
      "end_seconds": 39.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.75,
      "end_seconds": 43.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I'd give it a five, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.17,
      "end_seconds": 48.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Okay, any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.12,
      "end_seconds": 54.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "An occasional headache goes along with it, most of the time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.08,
      "end_seconds": 57.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "what about leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.19,
      "end_seconds": 61.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "No, no leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.22,
      "end_seconds": 66.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Any breathlessness, visual changes or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.74,
      "end_seconds": 73.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "no breathlessness, visual changes or chest pain, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.28,
      "end_seconds": 78.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.66,
      "end_seconds": 82.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.62,
      "end_seconds": 88.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.55,
      "end_seconds": 98.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to tramadol, but I don't remember what reaction I had"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.3,
      "end_seconds": 114.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.72,
      "end_seconds": 122.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "no surgery, um, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.34,
      "end_seconds": 133.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.77,
      "end_seconds": 138.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "no, I don't take any tablets"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.67,
      "end_seconds": 140.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.68,
      "end_seconds": 143.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.1,
      "end_seconds": 147.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "right, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.48,
      "end_seconds": 152.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.46,
      "end_seconds": 157.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.21,
      "end_seconds": 162.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.8,
      "end_seconds": 183.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.73,
      "end_seconds": 195.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.03,
      "end_seconds": 210.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 164 over 93, saturation 97 percent, heart rate 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.26,
      "end_seconds": 216.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'd like to to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.53,
      "end_seconds": 220.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.59,
      "end_seconds": 247.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is a little raised in the clinic but your heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.27,
      "end_seconds": 248.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.94,
      "end_seconds": 263.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like possible white-coat blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.07,
      "end_seconds": 266.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.5,
      "end_seconds": 275.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible white-coat blood pressure do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.03,
      "end_seconds": 297.92,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "Let's get a 24-hour blood pressure monitor, for raised clinic blood pressure. Cut back on salt and do a week of home readings. I'll want another look after the monitor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.02,
      "end_seconds": 301.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "yes, um, that's manageable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.82,
      "end_seconds": 308.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "let me check I've been clear what will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.43,
      "end_seconds": 315.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "So, um, I come back after the monitor. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.07,
      "end_seconds": 323.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.51,
      "end_seconds": 326.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "that's clear, thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.54,
      "end_seconds": 328.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Have a a good day."
    }
  ]
